://si.imgix.net/23f034e1/uploads/origins/75d47abc-4a68-4b7e-903b-88465bf29d91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d43e340926216d53e28adf11ff259f65, https://si.imgix.net/23f034e1/uploads/origins/75d47abc-4a68-4b7e-903b-88465bf29d91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=360f3178fc3b2e9d03460ec2db01f1ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23f034e1/uploads/origins/75d47abc-4a68-4b7e-903b-88465bf29d91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9682732643898df14619847cc5c7cdc3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！(*^_^*)私のキャラクター、アンシアとアークナイツのクロースを描いていただけたらと思います。女友達なので、春のデートのようなロマンチックでかわいい雰囲気が希望です。この絵が好きです！https://skeb.jp/@ysk_owo/works/4 .横構図で描いてください。\n\nアンシアはシャイで甘えん坊で勉強家。赤ら顔になったらかわいいですね。髪の金色の輝きと、角の黒い結晶も忘れないでください。参考： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uXzgaZOTVagRdH2ctaU6gEA74GKwJU2M?usp=sharing\n\nKroosは陽気で怠け者で、Antheaをからかうのが好き。目はいつも閉じている。参考： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mg323wWin1pgntDLNJwf7oHI4WbMADzr?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ysk_owo/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32bd2e1c/uploads/origins/08d7fa9d-2b86-41dd-9e55-93facf812b26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a67899da98f4694caa6352be4ead0ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/32bd2e1c/uploads/origins/08d7fa9d-2b86-41dd-9e55-93facf812b26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a67899da98f4694caa6352be4ead0ae, https://si.imgix.net/32bd2e1c/uploads/origins/08d7fa9d-2b86-41dd-9e55-93facf812b26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a7cc561886facf706f400252fdd92dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/32bd2e1c/uploads/origins/08d7fa9d-2b86-41dd-9e55-93facf812b26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1d88670394b483950ef7f65886999a9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your chibi/ SD work is so cute! I really admire it! I especially like this one and would to have something similar in size: https://twitter.com/ysk_owo/status/1617097363364904961?s=21&t=b65HxIUg9TAF_wtKlMf4FA\n\nI would like sensei to draw these two children! In these outfits please: https://sta.sh/21dmyw8q4ujm?edit=1\n\n🍓 👼 Chuchu: A lively and bright girl! She is energetic and a tomboy. She is dressed like an Angel / Fairy for the school performance and play! \n\nRu Yi🫐🍫: The boy is grumpy and quiet. A little too serious for a child... \n\nChuchu (1) often annoys Ru Yi (2) and is too affectionate. The boy doesn't approve, but in the end, he thinks of her as a friend.\n\nRequest: I would like Chuchu to hold many heart shaped balloons if possible! They can be floating behind her. Chuchu is smiling at RuYi. RuYi is holding a script since he is practicing his lines for the performance. \n\nOther items for decoration: heart plushies and flowers. Sensei can add their pets/mascots too! Anything else is fine!\n\nMore references:  https://sta.sh/21ge7kfx78mp?edit=1\n\nSensei can cancel if this request is not appropriate! Thank you.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21dmyw8q4ujm?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ysk_owo/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/95ae2149/uploads/origins/ca098a56-e3ab-4797-8c11-ccf111c7defe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e0d760a73e441fb38185764e4b4e973", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/95ae2149/uploads/origins/ca098a56-e3ab-4797-8c11-ccf111c7defe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e0d760a73e441fb38185764e4b4e973, https://si.imgix.net/95ae2149/uploads/origins/ca098a56-e3ab-4797-8c11-ccf111c7defe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e67153df0c7f8215b3a5052b2e3b481 2x, https://si.imgix.net/95ae2149/uploads/origins/ca098a56-e3ab-4797-8c11-ccf111c7defe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfd260bde9aac5d922eaeb43a3dc70b1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\nあなたの絵はとてもかわいいです\n\nもし可能であれば、リクエストさせていただいてもよろしいでしょうか？\nご不快ならキャンセルしてください。\n\nこの二人のキャラクターを一緒に描いてほしいです。https://sta.sh/22bam0d10qc5?edit=1\n\n女の子は私のキャラクターで、男のキャラクターはゲーム「ファイアーエムブレム」のクロードです。\n\nポーズ、表情、構図は自由で、二人が一緒にいて幸せならそれでいい。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/22bam0d10qc5?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ysk_owo/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/821e5913/uploads/origins/6b74fa7d-a187-414f-b770-e61aae38bcfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6b34948ed21eee735554ba3f1ed2f7b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/821e5913/uploads/origins/6b74fa7d-a187-414f-b770-e61aae38bcfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6b34948ed21eee735554ba3f1ed2f7b, https://si.imgix.net/821e5913/uploads/origins/6b74fa7d-a187-414f-b770-e61aae38bcfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81b6f0a7bb62457e1f71aa781d673e73 2x, https://si.imgix.net/821e5913/uploads/origins/6b74fa7d-a187-414f-b770-e61aae38bcfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e55044bcf031992c52bf10c10bf4e25e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵の作品は本当にかわいいです。私のVtuberのミンダを描いてくれませんか？\nミンダは天使と悪魔の姿をしているのですが、両方一緒に描いていただけませんか？\nポーズはおまかせします。かわいくて、なまめかしい元気な感じにしてほしいです。\n\nミンダエンジェル参考：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rERBc6HftNKDx8nLwrJXLIG0NS0xALBk/view?usp=sharing\nミンダデモン参考：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WxY2YlieOTZ1lIjpC7DJxNMjk061q5Ki/view?usp=sharing\n\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ysk_owo/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f831d18e/uploads/origins/64fbe7d2-c077-4673-8263-161ec6bf92ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69a8b21843bf0f901ef053acb0250c6c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f831d18e/uploads/origins/64f